	quest.4EC96B81D46D02DD.quest_desc: [
		"&3&l» Claim Chunks In A Radius"
		"&8&m                                "
		""
		"&7Claims a square block of chunks centered on you"
		"&7in a single command, fast base protection."
		""
		"&b&lUsage:&r  &f/ftbchunks claim-radius <n>"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A radius of 1 claims a 3x3 square (9 chunks). Watch your claim limit before going big."
