		"&6&lMekanism"
		"&8&m                                "
		""
		"&7The most advanced tech mod. Quintuple your ores, run"
		"&7chemical processing and tap into nuclear energy."
		""
		"&6&lBranch:&r &fTechnology"
		"&6&lStage:&r &fMid game"
		""
