		"&6&lThe Industrial Turbine"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Assemble casing, rotors, blades, vents, valves, dispersers,"
		"&7coils and condensers into one giant turbine multiblock."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fIndustrial Turbine"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Pair it with a boiler or reactor for a true power plant."
	]
