			"&c&lHunt 200 Bogged"
			"&8&m                            "
			""
			"&7A swamp skeleton bristling with poisoned arrows."
			"&7Two hundred felled, your name spreads."
			""
			"&c&lCategory:&r &fVanilla Mobs"
			""
			"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Track them in their usual haunts and bring sharp gear."
