		"&d&lPointed Dripstone"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Right-click an Apotheosis spawner with pointed dripstone"
		"&7to lower the starting health of the mobs it spawns."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fMob Tweaks"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Each use cuts 5% health, down to a floor of 20%. Easier kills."
